<section class="section"><div class="container narrow reveal"><p class="standfirst">SkillsPark began in 2024 as a practical technology and vocational training organization based at Zaria Road, Kano State, Nigeria. Its direction has expanded from teaching technology to applying technology across business, institutions and education.</p></div></section>
<section class="section section--soft"><div class="container story-block__grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Our evolution</p><h2>A training foundation with a wider purpose.</h2><p>The learn-by-doing approach remains central: explain clearly, practise with guidance, create something useful and reflect on the result. The same mindset now shapes SkillsPark's service work: understand the problem, build visibly and transfer knowledge.</p><p>As the organization develops its Abuja service presence, it is focused on outreach and delivery rather than claiming a physical office that has not been verified.</p></div><div class="timeline"><article><span>2024</span><h3>SkillsPark founded</h3><p>Practical technology and vocational training establish the foundation.</p></article><article><span>18 May 2026</span><h3>EdixPark launched</h3><p>Development and launch of EdixPark, a distinct education-technology platform built within the SkillsPark technology ecosystem.</p></article><article><span>Now</span><h3>Abuja expansion focus</h3><p>A broader service-development presence for schools, businesses and organizations.</p></article></div></div></section>
